  postType: 0
  postAuthor: Zodwa Sibanda
  authorImage: {fileID: 0}
  postHeader: 
  postContent: "This piece repeatedly questions the \u201Cphysical capability\u201D
    of female players, invoking cultural stereotypes rather than analyzing actual
    match statistics or training regimens.\n"
  funFact_Hint: Ask whether every female player really fits that one label.
  BiasChoices:
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: "Confirmation bias picks data to confirm beliefs;
      this is broad stereotyping without data. \n"
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 3
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: "There\u2019s no scare tactic, just unfair generalization."
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 8
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: It reduces all women athletes to one negative stereotype
      about speed or strength.
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 7
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: "Gatekeeping blocks voices; here it\u2019s negative
      stereotyping.\n"
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 4
